ingredients:
  - "1/4 cup wheat flour"
  - "1/4 cup frozen peas"
  - "1/2 tsp cumin seeds"
  - "1/2 tsp red chili powder"
  - "1/2 tsp salt"
  - "1 tbsp oil (15 ml)"
instructions:
  - "In a mixing bowl, add wheat flour, salt, and cumin seeds. Mix well and knead it to form a soft dough. Cover and let it rest for 10-15 minutes."
  - "Roll the dough into a small circle and stuff mashed boiled peas in the center of the rolled dough circle."
  - "Add red chili powder on top of the peas."
  - "Gently fold the dough and roll gently."
  - "Cook the rolled paratha on the tawa with oil."
  - "Serve the Peas Parathas hot with vegetable raita."
